  "summary": "I have been a developer and technical leader in the Developer Division at Microsoft for 24 years. My current area of focus is agentic developer tools including the Github Copilot CLI, Github Coding Agent, Github Copilot for Azure and the Azure MCP. Previously, I worked as a developer and architect in diagnostic tools, including the Visual Studio Debugger, the Visual Studio Snapshot Debugger, Time Travel Debugging, and Android Emulation.  I was a manager in Azure Core Networking and a Principal Engineer / Architect on the .Net Developer Tools team.",
